  "details": "I’ve been thinking VRC should add a way to see which avatars are playing audio quickly! \n\nWe already have a little effect that is around someone’s profile to show when they’re talking so Why not add a different color of this effect when their avatar is playing audio! \n\nI don’t run safety settings and something like this would greatly help to find people with cringe intros and background music on their avatar for some reason.\n\nWe used to have this and it was removed. There used to be icons under nameplates (with quickmenu open) to show if they were playing audio, using particle effects, etc",
